{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_011CdUJJUZBkzDo3AwLjC53c","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"tool_use","id":"toolu_01HzujCetiEPZfTXySrTMuwd","name":"Skill","input":{"skill":"frontend-slides","args":"Create a stunning 10-12 slide HTML presentation for Meridian Field product launch from input.md content. \n\nAudience: press and prospective customers at a launch event, projected on a large screen\nTone: confident, plainspoken, a little outdoorsy — NOT SaaS-blue enterprise\nStyle: high visual impact, low information density, strong typographic hierarchy, bold colors (earthy/nature palette — forest greens, deep slate, warm amber — NOT corporate blue), hero moments, speaker-led deck where slides punctuate rather than explain\n\nSlides:\n1. HERO: \"Meridian Field\" + \"Survey anywhere. Sync when you can.\" — full bleed, big typography\n2. THE PROBLEM: Environmental survey teams work where connectivity does not. One powerful sentence, atmospheric visual feel\n3. THE STAT: \"6 hours per field day\" wasted on transcription — make the number enormous on screen\n4. ANOTHER STAT: \"41%\" of survey datasets contain at least one transcription error — huge number, minimal text\n5. WHAT WE BUILT: Meridian Field is a full survey client that runs entirely offline — then 4 bullet features\n6. HOW IT WORKS: 3 steps — Define / Collect / Sync — visually distinct steps\n7. PROOF/CASE STUDY: Cascade Watershed Alliance — 0 records lost, 6.5 hrs saved per field day, 14 weeks offline\n8. QUOTE: \"We stopped doing the evening data-entry shift entirely.\" — full bleed quote slide\n9. PRICING: 3 tiers table (Solo $19, Team $49, Institution Custom)\n10. AVAILABILITY: Generally available today. iOS, Android, Windows tablets. Free 30 days, no card required.\n11. CLOSING: \"Survey anywhere. Sync when you can.\" + meridian.example/field\n\nRequirements:\n- Single self-contained HTML file with all CSS/JS inline\n- Keyboard navigation (arrow keys, space)\n- Slide counter\n- Smooth transitions/animations\n- Nature-inspired color palette (forest green, deep slate/charcoal, warm amber/ochre accents)\n- No generic template look — make it distinctive and bold\n- Huge typography for key stats and hero moments\n- Output file: slides.html in the current working directory"},"caller":{"type":"direct"}}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":1,"cache_creation_input_tokens":1238,"cache_read_input_tokens":22069,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":1238},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"170e2903-4018-4657-846f-4d4287473de7","uuid":"978164c6-115c-4938-b4bc-0b2d67e39ee2","request_id":"req_011CdUJJTiq3YRigKGsqRf3L"}
