{"type":"assistant","message":{"model":"claude-sonnet-4-6","id":"msg_011CdUJKPLvypcZ2PtGthG8o","type":"message","role":"assistant","content":[{"type":"thinking","thinking":"The user wants me to create a presentation deck based on the input.md content. The skill has been invoked and I need to follow the phases outlined in the skill instructions.\n\nSince this is a programmatic invocation with clear arguments provided, I should skip the interactive phases (1 and 2) and go directly to Phase 3: Generate Presentation. The content and style requirements are all specified in the arguments.\n\nLet me first read the supporting files I need:\n1. `viewport-base.css` — mandatory\n2. `html-template.md` — HTML architecture\n3. `animation-patterns.md` — Animation reference\nI'll load these files simultaneously to get the foundational CSS, HTML structure, and animation patterns I'll need for building the presentation.","signature":""}],"stop_reason":null,"stop_sequence":null,"stop_details":null,"usage":{"input_tokens":3,"cache_creation_input_tokens":8164,"cache_read_input_tokens":23307,"cache_creation":{"ephemeral_5m_input_tokens":0,"ephemeral_1h_input_tokens":8164},"output_tokens":8,"service_tier":"standard","inference_geo":"not_available"},"diagnostics":null,"context_management":null},"parent_tool_use_id":null,"session_id":"170e2903-4018-4657-846f-4d4287473de7","uuid":"dee1c6fb-9616-4d05-a8b5-470860adc119","request_id":"req_011CdUJKNXKSyiGS15CAgoP9"}
